<p>It writes kanji/characters in the sand in response to spoken queries. At least, it does when it's in its current form.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Not&nbsp;quite&nbsp;spoilers,&nbsp;but&nbsp;eh</a></div>
